.TH ARCHAIC 1 "December 2024" "Archaic 1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
archaic \- blazing-fast autocomplete daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B archaic
.B --daemon
.RI [ scan_path ]
.RI [ socket_path ]
.br
.B archaic
.B --version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B archaic
is a high-performance autocomplete daemon that indexes filesystems
and provides sub-millisecond path completions. It learns from usage
patterns to rank suggestions intelligently.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --daemon \fI[scan_path] [socket_path]\fR
Run the daemon. With one arg, the arg is a scan directory if it exists,
otherwise a socket path. With two args, scan path then socket path.
Without args, scan roots come from config plus ~/.config/archaic/roots.
.TP
.B --version, -v
Display version information and exit.
.SH FEATURES
.IP \(bu 2
Sub-millisecond query latency via radix tree and LRU cache
.IP \(bu 2
Intelligent scoring based on frequency, recency, depth, and type
.IP \(bu 2
Multi-threaded parallel filesystem scanning
.IP \(bu 2
Periodic auto-rescan to stay in sync with filesystem changes
.IP \(bu 2
State persistence across daemon restarts
.IP \(bu 2
Fuzzy matching for typo-tolerant completions
.IP \(bu 2
Recent files tracking with LRU eviction
.IP \(bu 2
Directory-only filtering for cd/mkdir commands
.IP \(bu 2
Colored output support (respects NO_COLOR)
.SH ARCHITECTURE
Archaic uses a multi-component architecture:
.IP \(bu 2
.B Daemon
: Background process holding the index
.IP \(bu 2
.B CLI
: Command-line interface for control
.IP \(bu 2
.B Helper
: Persistent connection handler for shells
.IP \(bu 2
.B Shell Plugins
: Integration for Fish, Bash, and Zsh
.SH SIGNALS
.TP
.B SIGTERM, SIGINT
Save state, then graceful shutdown.
.TP
.B SIGHUP
Reload configuration (rescan interval, log level) without restart.
.TP
.B SIGUSR1
Save state and keep running.
.TP
.B SIGUSR2
Save state (dump) and keep running.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/archaic/config.toml
User configuration file.
.TP
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/archaic.sock
Default Unix domain socket (else /tmp/archaic-$UID.sock).
.TP
.I ~/.cache/archaic/state.bin
Default state file location ($XDG_CACHE_HOME/archaic/state.bin when set).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR archaic-cli (1),
.BR archaic-helper (1),
.BR archaic.conf (5)
